#. Plugin Name
msgid "Gold Price Updater"
msgstr "بروزرسان خودکار قیمت طلا"

#. Plugin URI
msgid "https://github.com/hamidahangaryan/gold-price-updater"
msgstr "https://github.com/hamidahangaryan/gold-price-updater"

#. Description
msgid "Automatic gold price sync for WooCommerce: fetch, validate, buffer, and recalculate every managed product with a dedicated pricing engine."
